  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Tour Bite + Vanquish is an official hybrid string system pairing Tour Bite in the mains with Vanquish in the crosses. Tour Bite supplies explosive spin, power and ball bite, while Vanquish's DuPont high-modulus polyamide multifilament construction adds touch, comfort and arm-friendly playability. The combination is ideal for players seeking the performance of polyester without the harshness of a full polyester setup.",

    "zh": "Solinco Tour Bite + Vanquish 是官方 Hybrid 混穿套装，采用 Tour Bite 作为主线、Vanquish 作为横线。Tour Bite 提供强大的旋转、力量与咬球能力，而 Vanquish 多芯线则利用 DuPont 高模量聚酰胺纤维带来更好的手感、舒适性与护肘表现。整体适合希望获得聚酯线性能，同时降低全聚酯线床硬度的球员。"
  },

